---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Page not found" description="That page does not exist on this site." noindex={true}>
  <div class="wrap">
    <section>
      <p class="kicker">404</p>
      <h2>That page is not here</h2>
      <p>
        Either it has not been written yet, or the address is wrong. The site is being built a few
        pages at a time, so a link from a plan or a letter can arrive before the page does.
      </p>
      <p>
        Start from <a href="/">the four layers</a>, or read
        <a href="/why">why this project exists</a>. Everything that is not on the site yet is in
        <a href="https://github.com/ief-global/thamizh-mcp-design">the design repo</a>, which is public.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
